{"id":"vod_sn_39004","vodId":"39004","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天真与闪电","name_cn":"天真与闪电","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/fa32fe73223fa47eac7679ac05ddb194.jpg"},"summary":"身为高中数学老师的犬冢公平（中村悠一 配音）的妻子去世，留下五岁的女儿犬冢䌷希（远藤璃菜 配音）的父亲相依为命。善良而又负责的公平细心的呵护着女儿，却独独在做饭这件事情上力不从心，父女两人只得用外卖来应付一日三餐。　　某日，带着女儿赏花的公平遇见了自己班上的学生饭田小鸟（早见沙织 配音），并且得知小鸟的母亲经营着一家料理屋，于是，公平决定带着䌷希去那里吃饭，哪知道店中坐镇的，却只有亦不擅长料理的小鸟，于是，小鸟决定代替母亲，亲自下厨，最后却发展成为了三人一起下厨，就这样，一段充满了温情和欢笑的美食物语在餐桌和厨房之间展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pmg3CdVN2i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6hBLucmuGi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Uv4xr3hMrD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aJtf8i84xX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/t6fsEuTvtA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/eZ2aTsfXpH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/NajbMBs9wc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SjWrWJMqKn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PgkT38Shu31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/VNpcDEn20X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Qi9BrDh9Xw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cZicE5fY7f1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.651Z"}